"m1"
"m2"
== reflection names the owner, and the last body's report
["#<Class:Reflect>", "r1"]
["#<Class:Reflect>", 1, "r2!"]
== singleton_method_added reports each definition where it stands
[:a]
[[:a, :a], "a2"]
